In the donghua the Celestial Ascension Fruits were renamed to the Demonic Possession Fruits. I disagree with that terminology. The state Wang Lin ends up in after consuming the fruit is due to his inner killing intent plus the fact that he overused the Demonic Finger before Ascendant and also because he cultivated the Celestial Slaughter Art. For other people the fruits will have other effects and this has implications later in the story. We'll see how they adapt it now...\NAlso, it was shown but not explained, the Death Finger can absorb energy.\N\NThese fruits are only the size of a baby’s fist, and they are completely purple and give off a strange fragrance. If a person were to eat one, they would become excited and feel extreme pleasures. This is why this fruit is called Celestial Ascension Fruit.\N\NIf a mortal were to eat one, they would become addicted, but it wouldn’t affect a cultivator much. However, there are cultivators who enjoy eating the fruit and losing themselves in that intoxicating feeling.\N\NIn the mortal world, only the rich and powerful can get Celestial Ascension Fruits from cultivators after paying a heavy price. Then they can immerse themselves in the intoxicating feeling like they have become celestials themselves.

